{"id":"cda5a0ee-e285-4d60-9d6b-0f5794d395ca","createdAt":"2026-10-26T16:07:58.917Z","batchId":"settings_claude-opus-5-5_low","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-opus-5-5","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1 class=\"h1\">Account settings</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Manage your profile, choose how we contact you, and control who can see your activity.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm\" role=\"tablist\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm tab\" data-tab=\"profile\">Profile</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm tab\" data-tab=\"notifications\">Notifications</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm tab\" data-tab=\"privacy\">Privacy</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <section id=\"profile\" class=\"panel card stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"between row\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Profile</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">This information appears on your public profile and in team directories.</p>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Verified email</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row gap-lg center\" style=\"justify-content:flex-start\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\">MR</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <strong>Maya Reyes</strong>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Member since March 2021</span>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Change photo</button><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Remove</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n      <label>Full name<input type=\"text\" value=\"Maya Reyes\"></label>\n      <label>Display name<input type=\"text\" value=\"mayar\"></label>\n      <label>Email<input type=\"email\" value=\"maya.reyes@northwind.io\"></label>\n      <label>Phone<input type=\"tel\" value=\"+1 415 555 0182\"></label>\n      <label>Time zone<select><option>Pacific Time (UTC−08:00)</option><option>Eastern Time (UTC−05:00)</option><option>Central European Time (UTC+01:00)</option></select></label>\n      <label>Language<select><option>English (US)</option><option>Español</option><option>Deutsch</option></select></label>\n    </div>\n    <label>Bio<textarea rows=\"3\">Product designer focused on accessible data tools. Based in Oakland.</textarea><span class=\"small muted\">Up to 160 characters. Visible to anyone who can see your profile.</span></label>\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Last saved 2 days ago</span>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn save\">Save profile</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"notifications\" class=\"panel card stack gap-lg\" hidden>\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Notifications</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose the channels for each type of update. Security alerts are always sent by email.</p>\n    </div>\n    <table class=\"table\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Activity</th><th>Email</th><th>Push</th><th>SMS</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Mentions and replies<div class=\"small muted\">When someone @mentions you</div></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Task assignments<div class=\"small muted\">New or reassigned tasks</div></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Weekly summary<div class=\"small muted\">Every Monday, 8:00 AM</div></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Product updates<div class=\"small muted\">New features and tips</div></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Security alerts <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Required</span><div class=\"small muted\">New sign-ins, password changes</div></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n      <label>Email digest frequency<select><option>Instantly</option><option selected>Hourly digest</option><option>Daily digest</option></select></label>\n      <label>Quiet hours<select><option>Off</option><option selected>10:00 PM – 7:00 AM</option><option>Weekends only</option></select><span class=\"small muted\">Push and SMS are paused; email still arrives.</span></label>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" id=\"mute\">Pause all for 24 hours</button>\n      <button class=\"btn save\">Save preferences</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"privacy\" class=\"panel card stack gap-lg\" hidden>\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Privacy</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Control your visibility and how your data is used.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n      <label>Profile visibility<select><option>Public</option><option selected>Members of my organization</option><option>Only me</option></select></label>\n      <label>Who can message you<select><option>Anyone</option><option selected>People I work with</option><option>No one</option></select></label>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Show online status</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Show my email on my profile</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Allow search engines to index my public profile</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Share anonymous usage data to improve the product</label>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h3 class=\"h4\">Security</h3>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><div><strong>Two-factor authentication</strong><div class=\"small muted\">Authenticator app · enabled Jan 12, 2024</div></div><span class=\"badge\">On</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><div><strong>Active sessions</strong><div class=\"small muted\">3 devices · MacBook Pro (current), iPhone 15, Chrome on Windows</div></div><button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Sign out others</button></div>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><div><strong>Download your data</strong><div class=\"small muted\">Archive is emailed within 24 hours</div></div><button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Request export</button></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"alert alert-destructive row between\">\n      <div><strong>Delete account</strong><div class=\"small\">Permanently removes your profile, files and history. This cannot be undone.</div></div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-destructive btn-sm\">Delete account</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><button class=\"btn save\">Save privacy settings</button></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <p id=\"toast\" class=\"alert\" hidden>Changes saved.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t=>t.onclick=()=>{\n  document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(b=>b.className='btn btn-ghost btn-sm tab');\n  t.className='btn btn-secondary btn-sm tab';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.panel').forEach(p=>p.hidden=p.id!==t.dataset.tab);\n});\nconst toast=document.getElementById('toast');\nfunction show(m){toast.textContent=m;toast.hidden=false;clearTimeout(window._t);window._t=setTimeout(()=>toast.hidden=true,2500);}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.save').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>show('Changes saved.'));\ndocument.getElementById('mute').onclick=e=>{e.target.textContent='Paused until tomorrow';show('Notifications paused for 24 hours. Security alerts still arrive.');};\n</script>","deltas":[[1734,"<div"],[1798," class=\"page st"],[1860,"ack gap-lg\">"],[1913,"\n  <div class=\"st"],[1963,"ack g"],[2016,"ap-sm\">\n    <"],[2065,"h1 class=\"h1\">"],[2114,"Account settings</h1>"],[2166,"\n    <p class=\"lead"],[2219," muted\">Manage your prof"],[2265,"ile, cho"],[2595,"ose how we"],[2595," contact you, and control who can"],[2595," see your activ"],[2595,"ity.</p>\n  </"],[2595,"div>\n\n  <div class=\""],[2595,"row gap-sm\" role"],[2617,"=\"tablist\">\n    <"],[2669,"button class=\"btn bt"],[2715,"n-sec"],[2763,"ondary bt"],[2813,"n-sm tab\""],[2865," data-tab=\"profile\">"],[3022,"Profile</button>\n    "],[3023,"<button class=\"btn btn"],[3023,"-ghost btn-s"],[3068,"m tab\" data-tab"],[3121,"=\"notifications\">Notif"],[3165,"ications</button>\n    <button"],[3216," class=\"btn btn-"],[3267,"ghost btn-sm t"],[3317,"ab\" data-tab=\"priv"],[3365,"acy\">Privacy</"],[3415,"button>\n  </div>"],[3465,"\n\n  <section id"],[3516,"=\"profile\" class=\"pan"],[3568,"el card stack gap-l"],[3631,"g\">\n    <div class=\""],[3677,"between"],[3717," row"],[3770,"\">\n      <div>\n        "],[3819,"<h2 class=\"card"],[3868,"-title\">Profile</h"],[3917,"2>\n        <p class=\""],[3970,"card-desc\">This information app"],[4016,"ears on your public profile and"],[4066," in team"],[4118," direct"],[4185,"ories.</p>\n      </"],[4216,"div>\n      <span class=\""],[4265,"badge badge-secondary"],[4317,"\">Verified email